<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on Cathay Pacific.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Cathay Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Friday it has launched 250 million American-style call warrants on shares of Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$16.05     PREMIUM	 18.13 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.291     GEARING	 5.52x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 27.JUN.97    LISTING DATE  17.JUL.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  26.JUN.98    PAYDATE	 15.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$16.05</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT THE OPTION OF</p>
<p>			 ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
